WEBVTT

00:20.480 --> 00:23.360
[foreboding music playing]

00:23.440 --> 00:25.080
[fire crackling]

00:38.120 --> 00:39.920
[footsteps approaching]

00:40.000 --> 00:42.640
WHAT CAN MONEY BUY?

00:48.200 --> 00:51.920
That room is our lab
for botany experiments.

00:52.000 --> 00:54.040
That's for the students who love nature.

00:55.120 --> 00:58.640
And this is our room
for sewing and textiles.

00:58.720 --> 01:00.880
That's for the students
who are interested in fashion.

01:01.960 --> 01:04.400
Although the school has many
extracurricular activities,

01:04.480 --> 01:07.440
we still prioritize academics
or the students.

01:07.520 --> 01:11.360
Most importantly, we have received
many academic awards.

01:11.440 --> 01:13.480
[foreboding music continues playing]

01:21.080 --> 01:25.520
SPACECRAFT SIMULATION ROOM
MANIT PATNACHAI

01:26.560 --> 01:27.920
[teacher] What's the matter?

01:28.720 --> 01:30.400
Whose names are in the wall here?

01:31.600 --> 01:35.720
Oh, these are the names of the parents
who have donated money the rooms.

01:36.280 --> 01:38.160
Let me show you the other rooms, okay?

01:46.320 --> 01:49.120
[Nanno, in thought]
Money. What can it buy?

01:53.280 --> 01:54.640
A room?

01:54.720 --> 01:55.920
Fame?

01:56.520 --> 01:57.720
Objects.

01:58.360 --> 01:59.920
Social standing.

02:02.360 --> 02:03.520
Maybe…

02:04.600 --> 02:06.560
money can buy even more than that.

02:09.440 --> 02:11.280
[teacher]
And that's all the rooms we have.

02:11.840 --> 02:15.160
The rest are empty until we get
more donations from the parents.

02:15.880 --> 02:18.840
Let me show you
the classrooms downstairs, yeah?

02:41.320 --> 02:42.440
What's the matter?

02:43.160 --> 02:44.880
If I wanted to buy this room,

02:45.480 --> 02:47.080
that wouldn't be a problem, right?

02:49.760 --> 02:51.960
[whirring]

03:08.400 --> 03:09.600
Thank you so much.

03:31.720 --> 03:34.480
[theme music]

04:43.880 --> 04:44.960
[student 1] What are we eating tonight?

04:45.040 --> 04:46.360
[student 2]
I'm not hungry. Let's go bowling.

04:46.440 --> 04:47.960
[student 3] Hey, I want to have sushi.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.320
-[student 4] Yeah.
-[student 2] But when I see your hair,

04:49.400 --> 04:50.880
I want to have egg noodles.

04:50.960 --> 04:51.920
[all laughing]

04:52.000 --> 04:53.880
-Ramen.
-Hey, it's in fashion right now.

04:53.960 --> 04:54.880
-Here's your souvenirs.
-Oh!

04:54.960 --> 04:56.880
-[screaming, ululating]
-Hey!

04:56.960 --> 04:59.320
-[both cheer]
-Yeah!

04:59.400 --> 05:01.280
-Hey, why are you guys screaming about?
-That's a lot.

05:01.360 --> 05:03.440
You're acting like you've never been
to England before.

05:03.520 --> 05:06.320
[Tap] Hey, we screamed
because we're excited…

05:06.400 --> 05:08.840
Guys, you each owe me 2,000 baht
like you said.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.560
-That's just your allowance. Hurry.
-Come on. Hurry.

05:13.160 --> 05:16.840
We all made a quick bet if you would buy
more souvenirs than To.

05:16.920 --> 05:19.640
Damn. You way outdid him this time. Look.

05:20.240 --> 05:21.640
I thought I bought too much stuff.

05:22.440 --> 05:24.960
Man! You got way more shit than I did!

05:25.040 --> 05:26.320
[Whan laughs]

05:26.400 --> 05:29.800
To, why didn't you follow him around
to see what he bought

05:29.880 --> 05:31.840
and then buy one thing more than him?

05:31.920 --> 05:33.320
You traveled together, didn't you?

05:33.400 --> 05:36.360
Yeah, I made plans with him,
but he was never free to hang out.

05:36.440 --> 05:39.520
Hey, I had to spend time with
my parents too. I never get to see them.

05:40.080 --> 05:43.640
And you invited me to a football match,
but your seats were behind the goal.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.400
I never sit there.

05:45.480 --> 05:48.960
DINO AND FRIENDS

05:49.040 --> 05:50.680
Dino, well, he…

05:50.760 --> 05:52.800
Dino is the kind of person who…
How do we say it?

05:53.480 --> 05:54.880
Actually, if I didn't know him for years,

05:54.960 --> 05:56.920
I would think
he's a typical stuck-up rich person

05:57.000 --> 05:59.200
because he's someone
who seems to have everything.

05:59.280 --> 06:02.080
I mean, he's rich, and he comes
from a family with a lot of influence

06:02.160 --> 06:03.440
and people just can't get to know him.

06:03.520 --> 06:07.600
He's the kind of person who likes to bring
a lot of expensive things, man.

06:07.680 --> 06:10.600
Everything he buys is the best that money
can get you, you know what I mean?

06:10.680 --> 06:13.280
For example, the car he drives
is very expensive.

06:13.360 --> 06:15.720
Everything he has
is what adults can afford

06:15.800 --> 06:18.160
but not at all a kid would buy, you know?

06:18.240 --> 06:21.160
I invited you for a dinner at my hotel,
but you didn't come.

06:21.240 --> 06:23.200
Did you have the duck
at the Four Seasons instead

06:23.280 --> 06:24.760
for the rest of the Thai first group?

06:24.840 --> 06:26.200
[laughing]

06:26.280 --> 06:29.280
Didn't you say there was
a government minister with you

06:29.360 --> 06:32.040
at the Tower Bridge that day,
enjoying the scenery?

06:32.120 --> 06:33.440
Who would wanna go to that?

06:34.520 --> 06:35.520
-To.
-What?

06:35.600 --> 06:36.480
You really suck.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.160
You need to learn
how to do some networking.

06:38.240 --> 06:39.160
-[To] Why?
-Just in case

06:39.240 --> 06:41.840
you decide to become a government minister
in the future, you know?

06:41.920 --> 06:43.760
I don't think I can become
a government minister.

06:43.840 --> 06:44.760
[Pop] Fuck. You aim low.

06:44.840 --> 06:46.320
Dino?

06:46.800 --> 06:48.240
I think he likes to show off a bit.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.880
I don't know.
Hey, this is just my opinion.

06:50.960 --> 06:52.520
I asked a few of my friends
what they thought.

06:53.000 --> 06:55.320
I think he's a bit jealous of me.
I'm not really sure.

06:55.880 --> 06:58.840
But he's so rich.

06:59.960 --> 07:01.280
A new car…

07:02.560 --> 07:05.200
I think he might end of owning Thailand.

07:06.320 --> 07:08.520
-[Pop] Hey, guys.
-Stop. You're giving me a hard time.

07:08.600 --> 07:11.720
I saw someone's name in that room. Nanno?

07:11.800 --> 07:13.160
Who the hell is that?

07:13.240 --> 07:14.680
[Whan] Oh, that's the new student.

07:14.760 --> 07:18.200
She bought a room here on her first day.
She's filthy rich.

07:18.280 --> 07:19.280
Why did she do that?

07:20.320 --> 07:21.720
[Nanno] To start a company.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.680
Hello, I'm Nanno,

07:24.760 --> 07:26.920
and I'm the new owner of the room
and the company.

07:30.840 --> 07:31.960
Here.

07:38.400 --> 07:39.640
Here.

07:43.880 --> 07:44.960
What do you do?

07:45.920 --> 07:48.480
[teacher] Good morning, everyone.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.600
Fuck.

07:50.600 --> 07:52.200
-[Pop] Here we go again.
-Welcome back to school.

07:52.280 --> 07:54.640
It's nice to see everyone back again.

07:55.280 --> 07:58.840
Today, we will start the new term by…

07:59.480 --> 08:01.240
giving you last term's grade.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.560
[all boo]

08:02.640 --> 08:03.800
[Pop] I don't want it.

08:03.880 --> 08:07.240
Remember, what goes around
comes around, huh?

08:07.320 --> 08:08.200
Here.

08:08.280 --> 08:10.400
I really don't wanna see
my grades, though.

08:11.720 --> 08:12.720
[teacher] And for you.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.080
Let's look at it at the same time.

08:14.160 --> 08:16.840
-I got 2.48.
-One, two.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.960
[groans]

08:19.040 --> 08:20.800
You got 3.36?

08:21.520 --> 08:23.320
Fuck. This is so unfair.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.880
Look at my grades. It's so bad.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.680
My parents promised
to give me a motorbike.

08:30.360 --> 08:34.440
But they're totally going to downgrade
to a scooter when they see these grades.

08:35.919 --> 08:38.159
[Nanno] I can help you get the motorcycle.

08:38.799 --> 08:39.760
[Pop] How?

08:40.799 --> 08:42.400
Make an appointment with me.

08:43.840 --> 08:47.160
NANNO COMPANY LIMITED

08:50.160 --> 08:51.680
-Yeah.
-That'd be cool.

08:51.760 --> 08:52.960
Yeah.

08:55.200 --> 08:57.600
You promised to get me a motorcycle, yeah?

08:58.600 --> 09:00.080
Oh, I can get it for you,

09:00.160 --> 09:02.160
but that will require a little bit of work

09:02.240 --> 09:04.600
and that will require
a little processing fee.

09:12.040 --> 09:13.040
It's this much.

09:14.760 --> 09:16.440
I think that's pretty cheap,

09:16.520 --> 09:18.800
compared to the price
of the motorcycle that you want.

09:21.120 --> 09:23.200
-What do you think?
-Just try it. I would do it.

09:23.280 --> 09:24.520
-Yeah.
-What about you, man?

09:24.600 --> 09:25.560
It's cheap.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.760
-Yeah.
-[Whan] Come on, just do it.

09:41.800 --> 09:44.200
[Nanno] Great. Thank you very much.

09:45.880 --> 09:47.400
Give me your report card.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.600
I'll process this right away.

09:52.160 --> 09:53.480
[Whan] Just give it to her.

09:53.560 --> 09:54.920
Why does she want it?

09:55.000 --> 09:56.240
[Whan] I don't know. Just do it.

10:06.600 --> 10:07.720
-[Pop] Hey.
-[Whan] What?

10:07.800 --> 10:08.640
[Pop] Hey.

10:09.160 --> 10:11.440
-[Whan] What's she doing?
-[Dino] Is she really going to…

10:11.520 --> 10:13.080
[groans]

10:13.160 --> 10:15.160
[Whan laughing]
Shit.

10:15.240 --> 10:17.080
-My report card.
-[Whan chuckling]

10:20.400 --> 10:23.160
[Whan] Guys, look. She's recreating it.

10:23.240 --> 10:25.400
[suspenseful music playing]

10:34.040 --> 10:35.040
[Pop] How did she do that?

10:45.800 --> 10:49.800
-[Pop] I could just give my parents this?
-Yeah, wait a second.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.680
I'm sure you'll get your motorcycle now.

11:05.880 --> 11:06.840
Yeah.

11:07.920 --> 11:09.240
They're just the same.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.920
Yeah, they're exactly the same.

11:12.640 --> 11:14.360
[Nanno] I can do other things as well.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.480
What else can you do?

11:16.560 --> 11:18.440
[Nanno] Well, pretty much anything.

11:27.120 --> 11:29.760
NANNO COMPANY UNLIMITED

11:34.240 --> 11:36.920
Can Nanno Company really do
anything we want?

11:37.000 --> 11:38.200
Look at that.

11:38.280 --> 11:39.960
[engine revving]

11:58.640 --> 11:59.840
Som cheated on me.

12:07.520 --> 12:09.600
-Pat!
-You're begging?

12:09.680 --> 12:10.920
-Please!
-You're begging?

12:11.000 --> 12:12.480
Hey, Pat!

12:12.560 --> 12:13.920
[woman shrieks]

12:14.000 --> 12:15.040
[man growls]

12:15.120 --> 12:16.160
[chuckles]

12:16.240 --> 12:19.360
[woman continues shrieking]
Pat!

12:20.920 --> 12:23.760
Here. Get me a pretty one, yeah?

12:29.560 --> 12:32.280
I'm so proud of you.
You got yourself a girlfriend.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.440
Here's a check for you.

12:35.000 --> 12:38.040
-Appreciate it, Dad.
-She's really adorable.

12:39.880 --> 12:42.320
CAN YOU DO THAT
FOR THE SAKE OF YOUR FRIEND?

12:42.400 --> 12:46.000
Okay, that's it for today.
See you all tomorrow.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.120
[Pop] Goodbye, ma'am. See ya.

12:50.560 --> 12:52.000
Guys, let's go.

12:52.080 --> 12:54.760
-Dino, I have a question.
-[Pop] I'm hungry.

12:55.560 --> 12:57.680
Isn't there something I can help you with?

12:57.760 --> 12:59.080
-I'm already hungry.
-Nah.

12:59.160 --> 13:00.600
Are you gonna play snooker alone?

13:00.680 --> 13:03.600
Come on, Nanno.
He doesn't need any of your help.

13:03.680 --> 13:05.880
His family is wealthy.
He gets good grades.

13:05.960 --> 13:09.200
His parents live abroad.
He doesn't have a cheating girlfriend.

13:09.280 --> 13:13.640
Let's just say if you have any problems,
Dino can help you.

13:14.360 --> 13:15.760
Dude, are you crazy or something?

13:15.840 --> 13:18.160
Her company is already so big.
Why would she need my help?

13:18.240 --> 13:21.440
Well, she doesn't need
to worry about that,

13:21.520 --> 13:23.640
because the next customer
is going to be me.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.120
What do you need her help with?

13:25.760 --> 13:29.120
I wanna go out, but not to a nightclub
or anything like that.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.840
I want to go way over night,

13:30.920 --> 13:33.680
so I want Nanno to write a letter
to my parents.

13:33.760 --> 13:36.160
Let's say there's a camp
or something like that, okay?

13:37.360 --> 13:39.160
Hmm. What about Dhamma Camp?

13:39.680 --> 13:43.280
Oh, yeah, that's a great idea.
I always love going to Dhamma Camp.

13:44.840 --> 13:45.760
What?

13:45.840 --> 13:47.080
-Let me go, too.
-Yeah.

13:47.160 --> 13:49.800
You can't come up with it yourself?
Are you copying me?

13:49.880 --> 13:53.520
Yeah, I am, but I'm also thinking
of my friends, bringing all them with me.

13:53.600 --> 13:56.560
-Tap, To, Nanno, and Dino, too.
-I'll come.

13:57.040 --> 13:58.680
-Unlike you.
-Yeah, right.

13:58.760 --> 14:00.720
Just let her go on a trip by herself.

14:00.800 --> 14:02.320
[Whan] Hey, what the hell. Let me go, too.

14:02.400 --> 14:03.840
-You're too late.
-[Whan] No way.

14:03.920 --> 14:05.320
-Are we going to Osaka?
-Oh, come on.

14:05.400 --> 14:06.520
-I'm going too.
-Oh, no fucking way.

14:06.600 --> 14:07.440
I'm bored of Osaka.

14:07.520 --> 14:09.320
-Let's go to Hong Kong. I want congee.
-No.

14:09.400 --> 14:11.520
-I want to wear bikinis, you guys.
-I'm going, too.

14:11.600 --> 14:14.040
I'm going, too. Hello.

14:14.120 --> 14:15.560
-I'm going, too.
-Okay, okay.

14:15.640 --> 14:18.160
You can come as well, all right.
I feel bad for you.

14:18.240 --> 14:19.280
-You're right.
-But you know what…

14:19.360 --> 14:20.840
You can't choose where we go.

14:20.920 --> 14:23.120
-Hey.
-Dino, where are we going?

14:23.880 --> 14:25.120
I'm tired of going abroad.

14:26.040 --> 14:27.240
Fuck, he's bored.

14:27.320 --> 14:29.600
-Rich people are like this.
-Yeah, I guess that's true.

14:29.680 --> 14:31.640
He has been traveling abroad
since he was ten.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.040
Who wouldn't get bored with that?

14:33.560 --> 14:35.600
Then let's go somewhere in Thailand, yeah?

14:35.680 --> 14:37.600
Ugh, but I'm so bored of Thailand.

14:37.680 --> 14:39.160
-That's so lame.
-What shall we do?

14:39.240 --> 14:40.200
I don't care.

14:40.280 --> 14:42.160
-Why don't we go to a tea plantation?
-I don't want to.

14:42.240 --> 14:43.720
Can I suggest a place too?

14:46.160 --> 14:49.320
I wanna go to Dino's house.

14:49.400 --> 14:52.160
Damn. That'd be rad.

14:52.240 --> 14:54.320
I've heard a lot of great things about it,

14:55.200 --> 14:57.840
so I want to see your big mansion
with my own eyes.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.600
There's really nothing special.
It's just a normal house.

15:00.680 --> 15:03.040
From what I've heard,
this house has a big, beautiful garden.

15:03.120 --> 15:05.880
There's a massive swimming pool, a golf
room, a snooker room, and much more.

15:05.960 --> 15:06.800
It's completely clean…

15:06.880 --> 15:09.120
…that you can go horseback riding there.
It's so big.

15:09.200 --> 15:13.400
Tons of horses,
many expensive horses, I think.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.880
I heard he has…

15:15.560 --> 15:17.040
everything that…

15:18.440 --> 15:20.520
we, normal people…

15:21.560 --> 15:22.760
can't really afford.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.760
Like servants who will take off
your shoes. They'll do anything.

15:24.840 --> 15:28.360
And people to serve them breakfast in bed
whatever you want in the morning.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.600
Uh, I'm afraid you're gonna be sloppy
and break things.

15:31.680 --> 15:32.560
Oh, god.

15:32.640 --> 15:33.760
But, but, but…

15:33.840 --> 15:36.240
I promise that I'll be the one
who watches these guys,

15:36.320 --> 15:38.600
if anyone breaks anything in your house.

15:38.680 --> 15:43.360
I just wanna visit your house, even just
once in my lifetime, you know, Dino?

15:43.440 --> 15:45.480
It's not about the responsibility. It's…

15:45.560 --> 15:48.000
-Come on, Dino. We're your best friends.
-[Tap] Yeah.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.520
I think you can trust your friends.
Why don't you trust us?

15:50.600 --> 15:53.240
Yeah, or maybe you don't
consider us your friends, yeah?

15:53.320 --> 15:54.320
-[Dino] No, come on.
-Exactly.

15:54.400 --> 15:56.360
-Of course, you're my friends.
-[To] Yeah.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.920
-Come on.
-What's up with you?

15:58.000 --> 15:59.680
-Just do it.
-Please?

15:59.760 --> 16:01.520
-Come on.
-Yeah.

16:01.600 --> 16:04.040
-Hey, do it for your friends.
-Hey, stop. Hey, hey, hey. Come on.

16:05.280 --> 16:06.200
Fine.

16:06.280 --> 16:07.480
[all cheer]

16:07.560 --> 16:10.640
-The golf room is mine. Don't come in.
-I'm reserving the light displaying room.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.280
-Take the light room.
-Each take one.

16:12.360 --> 16:13.560
I'll meet you up later.

16:14.840 --> 16:16.240
-Bye now. See you.
-Bye.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.880
-Bye.
-See you tomorrow.

16:17.960 --> 16:21.360
I'll have that letter
for Dhamma Camp, if you want it.

16:23.000 --> 16:24.000
Thank you.

16:43.320 --> 16:47.360
GO HOME

16:47.440 --> 16:49.680
[upbeat music playing]

16:52.840 --> 16:57.120
[navigation voice] In 100 meters, turn
left. Your destination is on the right.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.840
Turn left over there.

17:13.319 --> 17:14.319
Oh, it's here. It's here.

17:17.040 --> 17:18.760
That would be 540 baht.

17:18.839 --> 17:20.920
[upbeat music continues playing]

17:48.280 --> 17:49.680
-Hello, Dad. Hello, Mom.
-[Dino's dad] Hey.

17:50.240 --> 17:52.480
You're back. Have you eaten?

17:52.960 --> 17:54.120
Yeah, Dad. I have.

17:54.800 --> 17:57.400
[Dino's mom] It's a bit messy.
We're getting a delivery out tomorrow.

17:58.360 --> 17:59.720
Do you need my help, Mom?

17:59.800 --> 18:02.040
No, it's okay.
You should do your homework first.

18:02.120 --> 18:03.360
We can do it ourselves, you know?

18:03.440 --> 18:04.960
Yeah, it's okay.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.120
Come on. Let me help you, Mom.

18:08.200 --> 18:09.680
No way.

18:09.760 --> 18:10.960
If you really want to help us out,

18:11.040 --> 18:13.200
why don't you concentrate
on your studies, okay?

18:14.880 --> 18:15.800
Okay.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.320
How's everything at school, hmm?

18:20.120 --> 18:21.960
Everything's fine, Dad.

18:22.600 --> 18:25.000
Actually, my friend sent a driver
to drop me off just now.

18:25.600 --> 18:28.200
Mm. That's a nice friend.

18:30.280 --> 18:32.040
Okay, I'm gonna go do my homework, Mom.

18:32.120 --> 18:33.040
Okay.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.240
Can you pass me that?

18:38.280 --> 18:40.640
[exhales]
This is good.

18:41.240 --> 18:42.280
Okay, that's done.

18:42.360 --> 18:43.880
Yeah, that one.

18:46.480 --> 18:49.800
WE CAN ALWAYS HIDE SECRETS

19:06.160 --> 19:07.040
[cell phone beeps]

19:08.560 --> 19:12.040
Tell me when we can come over,
so I can write that letter for you.

19:17.760 --> 19:20.640
I don't think I can let you
come over to my house.

19:28.560 --> 19:30.080
Let's go somewhere else.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.400
[cell phone beeps]

19:36.920 --> 19:39.440
I already bought a new dress
for the party at Dino's.

19:39.520 --> 19:42.560
Here's the theme. The theme… "Celebrity."

19:42.640 --> 19:43.480
[Whan chuckles]

19:44.600 --> 19:45.440
[cell phone beeps]

19:45.520 --> 19:47.920
No way.
Let's dress up as movie characters.

19:50.520 --> 19:51.800
[cell phone beeps]

19:51.880 --> 19:54.200
I have old glam outfits
for the red carpet.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.920
[cell phone beeps]

19:57.000 --> 20:00.040
Hey, can you guys stop chatting
and get in your fancy clothes already?

20:00.120 --> 20:01.960
Get dressed. Come on.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.080
[line ringing]

20:15.200 --> 20:16.560
[line ringing]

20:18.920 --> 20:19.920
[Nanno] Hello?

20:21.440 --> 20:24.720
Turns out I do need your help,
but can you keep a secret?

20:25.560 --> 20:26.640
Of course, I can.

20:26.720 --> 20:30.440
Client requests are always
strictly confidential.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.400
I want you to…

20:36.160 --> 20:37.480
change my friends' minds.

20:37.560 --> 20:39.200
Oh, why is that?

20:39.920 --> 20:44.080
Hey, I think it would be easier to solve
the problem by helping at your house,

20:44.160 --> 20:46.960
because your friends,
they really wanna go.

20:47.040 --> 20:47.960
[Nanno chuckles softly]

20:50.400 --> 20:52.440
-My house…
-What about it?

20:52.520 --> 20:53.360
[Dino clicks teeth]

20:57.520 --> 21:00.080
-I have valuable things there.
-Hmm.

21:00.760 --> 21:02.360
So, I don't want them to come.

21:02.440 --> 21:03.560
Uh-huh.

21:05.440 --> 21:08.480
Is there any way to do it?
Change their mind?

21:14.240 --> 21:15.680
Maybe it would be better…

21:19.080 --> 21:21.120
if you find another house.

21:21.200 --> 21:22.600
Is that what you really want?

21:24.440 --> 21:25.320
Mm-hmm.

21:26.360 --> 21:28.120
A house that they would like.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.120
Let me see…

21:29.880 --> 21:31.960
what that'll cost you.

21:37.360 --> 21:38.560
200,000.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.280
That's cheap, right?

21:41.880 --> 21:42.760
Yeah.

21:43.360 --> 21:46.240
All right, then.
Please give me the cash tomorrow.

21:47.080 --> 21:48.160
Is that okay with you?

21:56.280 --> 21:57.160
Okay.

22:11.160 --> 22:12.160
-Hey, Mom.
-Mm?

22:12.960 --> 22:13.960
Is there anything to eat?

22:14.040 --> 22:15.960
Oh, there's watermelon in the fridge.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.160
[Dino's mom] Did you find it?

22:24.160 --> 22:25.040
Yes, I did.

22:29.960 --> 22:31.040
[Dino's mom] Dino.

22:32.000 --> 22:34.080
I'm sorry I didn't remove the seeds.

22:35.520 --> 22:36.440
It's okay, Mom.

22:41.000 --> 22:42.440
[Dino's mom]
Have you gotten your bonus yet?

22:42.520 --> 22:43.960
The loan sharks won't stop asking.

22:45.000 --> 22:46.400
[Dino's dad] Why do they keep on asking?

22:46.480 --> 22:48.200
It's like we don't have a child
to take care of.

22:48.280 --> 22:50.480
-Have you received it?
-We need to pay for Dino's tuition.

22:50.560 --> 22:51.640
Have you gotten it?

22:51.720 --> 22:53.960
Yes, in our bank account.

22:54.040 --> 22:55.880
-How much is it?
-It's 200,000 baht.

22:55.960 --> 22:57.840
Good. We can pay them back right away,

22:57.920 --> 23:00.200
because I've heard if anyone
doesn't pay them back,

23:00.280 --> 23:01.760
they'll hire a gangster to kill them.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.320
[Dino's dad] Yeah, I know.

23:06.200 --> 23:08.160
Dino, you're a big liar.

23:08.240 --> 23:11.400
Fuck you! How can we be friends
with someone like you for this long?

23:11.480 --> 23:15.520
You lived in a crappy house, but you
always act like you were so freaking cool.

23:15.600 --> 23:18.400
You fucking smell that?
You reek of a poor, Dino.

23:18.480 --> 23:20.480
[suspenseful music playing]

23:25.240 --> 23:30.200
THE ATM IS 1.5 KM AWAY

23:30.280 --> 23:33.000
[beeping in a normal pace]

23:44.880 --> 23:48.400
[beeping faster]

23:48.480 --> 23:51.320
[beeping slows down]

24:21.640 --> 24:23.200
Hey, Dino.

24:23.800 --> 24:25.160
What are you doing?

24:27.400 --> 24:28.760
I was just getting some water.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.240
You can pour me a glass, too.

24:33.320 --> 24:34.240
Here you go.

24:34.880 --> 24:35.840
Very good, son.

24:42.040 --> 24:44.160
-I'm going back to bed.
-Mm.

24:44.240 --> 24:45.680
-Don't stay up late, okay?
-Okay.

24:45.760 --> 24:47.880
[somber music playing]

25:14.640 --> 25:16.920
AN ORDINARY MORNING

25:19.360 --> 25:22.240
[Dino's dad]
Hey, I told you my money is gone.

25:23.800 --> 25:24.680
Wait a minute.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.560
How can you not take responsibility

25:26.640 --> 25:28.760
when my debit card is still here,
but the money has disappeared?

25:29.360 --> 25:30.400
Don't you understand?

25:30.480 --> 25:32.200
Just go. It's nothing.

25:33.240 --> 25:36.760
Excuse me, are you really accusing
someone in my family of stealing?

25:37.520 --> 25:39.800
Hey, you're not taking any responsibility.

25:41.280 --> 25:42.640
I don't know. I don't know.

25:43.560 --> 25:45.520
You stop and listen.

25:45.600 --> 25:49.440
My bank card was with me the entire night.

25:50.680 --> 25:55.280
What? Who else would go
and take the money out?

25:55.840 --> 25:58.720
This is your fault. Check the account,
find the money, and put it back.

26:00.560 --> 26:01.920
That's it. Yeah.

26:05.920 --> 26:07.480
They should pay us back no matter what.

26:08.360 --> 26:09.880
What if we don't get it back?

26:09.960 --> 26:11.920
[Dino's dad sighs]
I don't know.

26:17.640 --> 26:19.200
DINO'S HOUSE

26:22.120 --> 26:23.720
How is it? Do you like it?

26:25.160 --> 26:26.560
[Dino] Actually, it's a bit small.

26:27.080 --> 26:29.760
Really? Do you want me to look
for a new one for you?

26:32.280 --> 26:33.240
It's fine.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.720
Can you show me around the house?

26:36.480 --> 26:38.600
I want to see how similar it is to mine.

26:38.680 --> 26:39.680
Of course.

26:51.800 --> 26:54.240
WHO WOULD BE AS FREE AS DINO?

26:54.320 --> 26:56.840
[classical music playing]

26:56.920 --> 26:58.720
[Whan and Pop laughing]

26:58.800 --> 26:59.920
[Whan] Fuck.

27:00.000 --> 27:01.560
-[Pop] Whoa.
-[Whan] Shit.

27:02.320 --> 27:03.560
This is your house?

27:03.640 --> 27:05.040
-[Pop] Wow.
-[To] It's so big.

27:05.760 --> 27:08.480
[Tap] Hey, you prepared an afternoon tea
for us, too? It looks really delicious.

27:08.560 --> 27:09.880
[To] Oh, my god.

27:09.960 --> 27:12.160
-[Pop] Where are you going?
-[Dino] You don't come here every day.

27:12.240 --> 27:14.600
[Whan]
Hey, is this from the era of Louis XIV?

27:15.080 --> 27:16.520
-It's so soft.
-Yeah.

27:16.600 --> 27:18.040
That's right. My dad has good taste.

27:18.120 --> 27:20.040
Dino, can I play golf?

27:21.000 --> 27:22.760
[Dino] Be careful not to destroy my house.

27:22.840 --> 27:24.880
-Yeah, I'll be careful.
-[Tap] Let's take pictures.

27:24.960 --> 27:26.760
-[Whan] Yeah.
-We're not gonna come back here.

27:26.840 --> 27:28.840
Hey, can I smoke this, man?

27:29.560 --> 27:32.080
[Dino] Go ahead. My dad won't notice.

27:32.720 --> 27:34.200
[Pop] It smells nice.

27:34.280 --> 27:35.600
What are you guys so excited for?

27:36.080 --> 27:37.720
You act like you've never seen
this kind of stuff.

27:38.520 --> 27:41.240
Our dads keep that kind of stuff
in our room.

27:41.320 --> 27:43.160
We're not allowed to touch it.

27:43.240 --> 27:45.560
That's totally true, actually.

27:45.640 --> 27:47.680
None of us have this much freedom as you.

27:49.040 --> 27:50.120
[blows]

27:50.760 --> 27:52.640
I think you should hold off
on smoking that.

27:52.720 --> 27:55.120
If you wanna smoke it,
you should have a whiskey, too.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.600
Right, Dino?

27:59.240 --> 28:00.880
-I'll get it, then.
-Which brand is the fur?

28:00.960 --> 28:02.080
You don't need to.

28:02.640 --> 28:03.800
I don't know. I took my mom's.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.120
You can call the servants.

28:05.200 --> 28:07.480
Yeah, right. Why get it yourself, man?

28:07.560 --> 28:09.440
-Mm-mm.
-[Dino] Oh, yeah.

28:11.720 --> 28:13.240
[To] What's the big deal?
[chuckles]

28:14.280 --> 28:16.720
Oh, my god.
He calls the servants with a bell.

28:16.800 --> 28:18.280
[all laughing]

28:18.360 --> 28:20.560
-[Tap] He's a rich kid.
-[Pop] Oh, that's great.

28:23.800 --> 28:25.920
Dino, whiskey.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.480
-[Pop] What about you?
-[To] I want tea.

28:29.000 --> 28:30.000
Whiskey.

28:33.360 --> 28:35.440
[Pop] Excuse me.
I would like some whiskey.

28:38.080 --> 28:39.320
Yes. As you wish.

28:41.120 --> 28:42.800
[Tap] Yeah, I want whiskey, too.

28:46.800 --> 28:48.560
[To] Tap, which kind of tea this is?

28:48.640 --> 28:49.960
Are you all right, Dino?

28:50.920 --> 28:52.240
-Yeah.
-[Tap] I think it's Earl Grey tea.

28:52.320 --> 28:54.520
-All right, then.
-I had this in London before.

28:54.600 --> 28:55.480
[To] Oh.

28:55.560 --> 28:56.640
[Whan] Hey, Dino.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.960
Why don't your parents have
any pictures in the house?

28:59.040 --> 29:00.920
I want to see the ambassador
and his wife, you know.

29:01.000 --> 29:03.360
-Yeah, me too.
-Right?

29:03.440 --> 29:05.040
We must have left
all our pictures in England.

29:05.120 --> 29:06.680
[Tap] I'm so jealous.
I've never been to Europe.

29:06.760 --> 29:09.640
If you wanna see
what Dino's parents would look like,

29:10.400 --> 29:12.880
we can look for them
on the newspaper or the Internet.

29:13.760 --> 29:14.840
Isn't that right, Dino?

29:17.640 --> 29:18.840
I'll go look for one.

29:20.800 --> 29:24.200
[Pop] No, sit down.
Just stay here with us.

29:24.280 --> 29:25.640
Let the servants get it.

29:27.560 --> 29:28.720
Excuse me.

29:28.800 --> 29:30.800
Can you get the pictures
of Dino's parents?

29:31.480 --> 29:33.360
-Yeah. We wanna see them.
-[Pop] Now, please?

29:36.680 --> 29:39.840
[To] Do you think his dad is handsome?
I mean, Dino's good-looking.

29:39.920 --> 29:42.600
-His dad's probably handsome, too.
-[Pop] Good point.

29:42.680 --> 29:44.000
[Whan] Yeah. He must be handsome.

29:44.080 --> 29:46.720
-[To] Here it is.
-[Whan] Wow.

29:46.800 --> 29:50.080
-[Whan] Hey. No way.
-Is that him, Dino?

29:53.160 --> 29:55.560
-[Pop] They don't look the same?
-[Whan] His dad is younger.

29:55.640 --> 29:57.040
and his mom is still young, too.

29:57.120 --> 29:57.960
[Tap] Mm-hmm.

29:58.880 --> 30:01.280
I also don't think Dino
looks like his parents.

30:01.800 --> 30:03.040
He looks more like…

30:03.520 --> 30:05.360
Everyone says that,

30:05.440 --> 30:08.480
but he actually looks more like
his grandfather at that age.

30:08.560 --> 30:09.400
[To] I see.

30:09.480 --> 30:12.240
[Tap] Oh, he looks like his grandpa.
His grandpa must be handsome.

30:12.320 --> 30:13.240
[Whan] I agree.

30:18.800 --> 30:19.840
Let's eat, then.

30:19.920 --> 30:21.480
[Tap] Sounds good. I'm starving.

30:21.560 --> 30:23.120
[Pop] Yeah, let's eat.

30:23.680 --> 30:25.800
Where's the kitchen? Take me there.

30:31.200 --> 30:32.400
[bell dings]

30:32.480 --> 30:33.560
THE ART OF EATING

30:33.640 --> 30:35.120
[all] Whoa.

30:35.960 --> 30:37.120
-[Pop] Looks so good.
-[Whan] It's delicious.

30:37.200 --> 30:39.640
Fuck, this is like
a Michelin-starred restaurant.

30:39.720 --> 30:41.000
Your cook is awesome.

30:41.080 --> 30:43.480
He must have been a chef
at a hotel before this.

30:43.560 --> 30:45.600
-[Tap] I agree.
-Well, this is Mr. Dino's house.

30:45.680 --> 30:47.240
Why would you think of the ordinary?

30:47.800 --> 30:48.800
[To] That's true.

30:49.640 --> 30:51.320
[Tap] Wow, it's so good.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.640
-[To] Which one?
-[Tap] Try this.

30:52.720 --> 30:54.120
-[To] This one?
-[Whan] Yeah, it's amazing.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.160
Hey, everyone.

30:55.240 --> 30:57.400
-Let's make a toast too.
-Okay, let's do it.

30:57.880 --> 31:00.560
-[all] Cheers!
-[Tap] Cheers! Yay!

31:02.320 --> 31:03.320
[Tap] Ugh!

31:04.720 --> 31:07.520
What the hell is this?
There's no way that's whiskey.

31:08.480 --> 31:11.680
I think you're too young to drink.
You're all underage.

31:11.760 --> 31:12.720
[all laugh]

31:12.800 --> 31:14.200
-Young?
-[all laughing]

31:14.280 --> 31:17.080
Wait, who do you think you are

31:17.160 --> 31:19.280
that you can tell us
what we can or can't drink?

31:19.360 --> 31:20.200
Yeah.

31:20.280 --> 31:21.960
I think servants shouldn't talk so much.

31:23.880 --> 31:25.160
[To and Tap laugh]

31:26.200 --> 31:27.280
[Pop] Whiskey!

31:31.360 --> 31:32.360
He's still not moving.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.480
Yes.

31:36.040 --> 31:38.920
Why is he being so annoying, man?

31:39.000 --> 31:40.360
[To] He's so fucking dumb.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.680
Dino is generous.

31:42.760 --> 31:45.800
If it were me, I would tell my dad
to fire his ass.

31:45.880 --> 31:47.360
[all laugh]

31:47.440 --> 31:49.200
I'm gonna stab you.

31:49.280 --> 31:51.760
You should listen to Dino,
you work friend.

31:51.840 --> 31:53.040
To is so cool, right?

31:53.120 --> 31:54.880
When he's at home,
he's not like this at all.

31:54.960 --> 31:56.560
-[Whan] Yeah.
-[Tap laughs]

31:56.640 --> 31:58.560
[Pop] Is he a pussycat when he's at home?

31:58.640 --> 31:59.760
[To] My dad is strict.

31:59.840 --> 32:00.960
[Whan chuckles]

32:01.040 --> 32:02.200
[Pop] Pour it for everyone.

32:04.080 --> 32:05.520
For Dino as well?

32:05.600 --> 32:07.160
[Tap, To, Whan, and Pop laugh]

32:07.240 --> 32:08.920
[Pop] What the fuck you think? Of course.

32:09.000 --> 32:10.560
[To] You don't serve the owner?

32:14.720 --> 32:15.720
Yes.

32:24.040 --> 32:25.360
-[Tap] The aroma's good.
-Yeah, it is.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.440
-[Pop] Raise a toast?
-Yeah.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.400
-Come on.
-Yeah.

32:27.480 --> 32:29.920
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

32:32.280 --> 32:33.520
-Mm.
-Mm. It's good.

32:33.600 --> 32:34.880
-It's good.
-[exhales]

32:34.960 --> 32:36.960
-Straight to the heart.
-This is the life.

32:38.040 --> 32:40.840
We do have whiskey and cigars.

32:42.560 --> 32:44.280
But I still think we can have more fun.

32:44.960 --> 32:47.000
That's why I brought some weed as well.

32:47.080 --> 32:49.320
-[Pop] Woo-hoo!
-[To] Ooh, all right!

32:49.400 --> 32:50.840
But this is my house.

32:50.920 --> 32:52.000
[Pop] So what?

32:52.480 --> 32:56.200
It's because this is your house
that we can do stuff like this.

32:56.280 --> 32:57.520
Fuck yeah.

32:58.200 --> 33:00.200
What if my parents come back and smell it?

33:00.280 --> 33:02.280
They'll get fucking high.

33:02.360 --> 33:03.880
Dino, what are you scared of?

33:03.960 --> 33:06.080
If the weed smells, let them deal with it.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.240
-Exactly.
-That's right.

33:07.320 --> 33:08.320
…them.

33:08.400 --> 33:10.680
-But I--
-Hey, Whan is totally right.

33:10.760 --> 33:12.800
What are servants here for anyway?

33:13.560 --> 33:15.440
It's also not very often

33:15.520 --> 33:18.600
that we can hang out like this
and have fun with no adults around.

33:18.680 --> 33:19.760
[Pop] Yeah.

33:19.840 --> 33:21.400
But I'm worried that my parents
might smell it.

33:21.480 --> 33:24.560
[Pop] Hey. Your parents
won't believe them anyway.

33:24.640 --> 33:27.440
You are the one who's in charge
what happens inside your house,

33:27.520 --> 33:28.800
not your servants.

33:28.880 --> 33:31.520
Anyway, if you tell them
not to say anything,

33:31.600 --> 33:33.600
they'll act like
we were never here, right?

33:33.680 --> 33:35.040
-[Whan] That's right.
-[Pop] That's true, yeah?

33:35.120 --> 33:36.960
-What's up with you?
-Come on.

33:37.040 --> 33:38.920
You all know that's what
we came here for, right?

33:39.000 --> 33:41.040
-Yeah.
-We can go somewhere else.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.120
-[Pop] Let's have some fun.
-Mm.

33:46.080 --> 33:46.960
Just have some.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.320
[To coughs]

33:50.400 --> 33:51.320
-[Pop] It's good stuff.
-[Whan] It's a little strong,

33:51.400 --> 33:52.400
but this smell is good.

33:52.480 --> 33:54.800
[Tap] I'm gonna smoke it all.
It smells fucking good.

33:59.040 --> 34:00.920
[Dino coughs]

34:01.000 --> 34:01.920
[Pop] Look at him.

34:02.000 --> 34:04.800
-[Pop] Come on.
-[Tap] Are you all right?

34:05.560 --> 34:08.239
I want to have you guys
come over to my house next time,

34:08.840 --> 34:11.920
but I can't invite you anymore
now that I've experienced Dino's house.

34:12.719 --> 34:13.840
-[Pop] Hey.
-[To] Huh?

34:13.920 --> 34:16.400
You tried to compare your house
to Dino's house?

34:16.880 --> 34:19.000
-Geez. I won't dare anymore.
-[Pop] Right?

34:20.080 --> 34:21.600
Hey, it's okay.

34:21.679 --> 34:22.960
[Pop] Come on, come on.

34:26.679 --> 34:29.639
[cutlery clattering]

34:32.600 --> 34:34.880
-[Tap] To, have some veggies.
-[Pop] I think the pork ribs…

34:34.960 --> 34:38.040
-I got it on my plate.
-It's good to have it with red wine.

34:38.120 --> 34:40.280
-[Tap] Hey, I want some.
-[Whan] Yeah, me too. I want some.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.440
[Pop] Get the red wine.

34:42.960 --> 34:45.080
Uh, you've all had too much already.

34:45.159 --> 34:46.120
[Pop] Whatever. Shut up.

34:46.199 --> 34:48.679
Dino. Your servants are ruining the party.

34:48.760 --> 34:50.120
[Tap giggles]

34:50.199 --> 34:52.440
[Dino] He's probably just worried.

34:53.080 --> 34:54.639
We've all had so much already.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.120
I mean, what if we throw up?

34:57.920 --> 34:59.480
-Just wipe it.
-[Pop] Who cares if we throw up?

34:59.560 --> 35:01.040
Having pork ribs…

35:01.920 --> 35:04.960
-with red wine is a fucking work of art.
-[To] Yeah.

35:05.520 --> 35:06.680
Come on, go get it.

35:11.960 --> 35:12.960
[Dino] Just get it.

35:14.440 --> 35:16.400
-[Pop] My glass is getting dusty now.
-[Dino's mom] It's all right.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.960
[Tap] I want red wine.

35:18.040 --> 35:20.840
-[Tap] I want to have red wine.
-[To] I want to have red wine.

35:20.920 --> 35:22.400
-[Pop] Hey.
-I'll go get it.

35:22.920 --> 35:25.760
[Pop] You should be as obedient as she is.

35:25.840 --> 35:26.680
[Tap] Yeah.

35:26.760 --> 35:29.360
[Pop] Look at this mug face.
Are you working at a casino?

35:31.080 --> 35:32.840
Wine, miss.
[gasps]

35:32.920 --> 35:34.360
-[Whan gasps] Shit.
-[To] Hey.

35:34.440 --> 35:35.720
This is brand new.

35:36.200 --> 35:37.760
[Pop] What the fuck.

35:37.840 --> 35:38.960
Hey, calm down now.

35:39.040 --> 35:42.080
[Pop] Your maid obviously did it
on purpose.

35:42.160 --> 35:44.040
You, you were all too young to drink.

35:44.120 --> 35:45.240
[Pop] Stop talking, man.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.520
Okay, then.

35:47.800 --> 35:49.680
-Let's get out of here
-But they were…

35:50.600 --> 35:52.000
Okay, let them clean this room.

35:52.080 --> 35:54.280
It's so annoying. Let's go, guys.

35:54.360 --> 35:55.840
[scoffs]
Fuck me.

35:57.520 --> 36:01.360
I'm being considerate of my host or else,
I would punch him in the face.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.200
Son…

36:27.400 --> 36:30.640
IS THIS FUN ENOUGH?

36:39.880 --> 36:40.960
This sucks!

36:41.480 --> 36:42.920
The wine's not coming off.

36:43.600 --> 36:45.440
She needs to buy me a new one.

36:46.200 --> 36:47.240
[door closes]

36:49.640 --> 36:50.800
I'll buy you a new one.

36:51.760 --> 36:53.040
They're getting on my nerves.

36:54.000 --> 36:55.120
[Tap] Hey.

36:55.200 --> 36:59.480
Look, we only get to hang out as a group
every once in a while, you guys, come on.

37:00.040 --> 37:02.880
We're alone. Those losers are gone.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.120
We can do whatever the fuck we want.

37:05.760 --> 37:08.120
How about we do
something crazy and fun, yeah?

37:08.640 --> 37:10.680
[To] Tap, you're scaring me.

37:10.760 --> 37:11.760
[Tap and Whan laugh]

37:11.840 --> 37:14.880
Hey, do you have anything else
besides golf, Dino?

37:14.960 --> 37:16.400
Is this fun enough for you?

37:16.480 --> 37:18.080
-Fuck!
-Hell, yeah.

37:18.160 --> 37:19.760
-[To] Fuck!
-[Pop] What the hell.

37:19.840 --> 37:22.000
Hey, that's something do to.

37:23.080 --> 37:24.360
How about this?

37:24.440 --> 37:25.480
Fuck, what?

37:25.960 --> 37:27.520
[Pop] I'll only load one bullet

37:28.160 --> 37:31.040
and whoever gets shot
will win the entire pot.

37:40.480 --> 37:42.560
Everyone, 200,000 baht,

37:43.080 --> 37:44.360
at you.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.080
[gun cocks]

37:55.000 --> 37:56.120
[Pop] Are you playing?

37:56.680 --> 37:59.400
Fuck, no way.
What if I shoot myself and die?

37:59.480 --> 38:00.560
-Yeah.
-[giggles]

38:01.040 --> 38:02.640
Just shoot your arm.

38:02.720 --> 38:04.800
[Pop] Whan, what do you want again?

38:04.880 --> 38:07.800
Chanel? You can buy six handbags.

38:08.560 --> 38:09.560
What do you say?

38:11.040 --> 38:14.560
Fuck. Fine. 200,000. Let's go.

38:15.240 --> 38:16.240
You?

38:17.800 --> 38:19.600
Yeah, let's go.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.160
And you?

38:22.240 --> 38:24.120
[Tap] Yeah, I'll do it too.

38:24.880 --> 38:27.080
-Nanno?
-Do you accept checks?

38:27.560 --> 38:28.520
Yeah.

38:29.360 --> 38:30.560
Dino, what about you?

38:34.240 --> 38:35.320
I'll do it.

38:36.400 --> 38:37.960
Cool. Then, I'll start first.

38:38.040 --> 38:40.720
[Tap] Fuck. He's really doing it.

38:40.800 --> 38:42.760
[suspenseful music playing]

38:44.240 --> 38:45.120
[gun clicks]

38:45.200 --> 38:47.080
-Fuck!
-Fuck!

38:47.160 --> 38:48.200
That was scary.

38:50.000 --> 38:51.240
It's your turn.

38:51.320 --> 38:53.320
[Tap] To, do it. It's 1.2 million baht.

38:53.400 --> 38:54.960
-It's my turn already?
-[Tap] Yeah.

38:56.240 --> 38:57.960
-Do it.
-[Tap] It's 1.2 million.

38:58.040 --> 38:59.040
Do it.

38:59.120 --> 39:02.120
[all] Do it. Do it. Do it.

39:02.200 --> 39:03.280
-[grunts]
-[gun clicks]

39:03.360 --> 39:05.160
-Fuck.
-[laughs]

39:05.240 --> 39:06.560
[breathing heavily]

39:06.640 --> 39:08.160
-You suck.
-Go get it.

39:08.240 --> 39:12.120
Wait and see. With my luck, I'll get it.

39:15.640 --> 39:18.840
-[all] New boobs. New boobs. New boobs.
-[Whan laughing]

39:18.920 --> 39:19.880
-[gasps]
-[gun clicks]

39:19.960 --> 39:20.920
[laughing]

39:21.000 --> 39:23.000
-[Pop] The boobs burst.
-[laughing]

39:23.080 --> 39:24.080
[Tap] Fuck!

39:24.160 --> 39:28.000
[laughing]

39:28.080 --> 39:29.240
All right, my turn.

39:30.120 --> 39:33.080
-You're brave.
-Six Chanel bags for you.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.240
Come on. Do it.

39:35.800 --> 39:40.280
[To and Pop] Six bags. Six bags. Six bags.

39:40.360 --> 39:41.520
[gun clicks]

39:41.600 --> 39:42.680
[To and Pop laugh]

39:42.760 --> 39:46.760
No Chanel bags for you, girlfriend.
[laughs]

39:46.840 --> 39:48.120
Fuck, it's Nanno's turn.

39:50.640 --> 39:51.920
-[Pop] Huh?
-[Tap] Come on!

39:52.000 --> 39:52.880
[gun clicks]

39:53.720 --> 39:54.800
[panting]

39:55.360 --> 39:56.960
-Here.
-[To] Are you fucking crazy?

39:58.440 --> 39:59.800
Dino's the last person.

39:59.880 --> 40:02.320
I think our host has a chance
to win it all, you guys.

40:02.400 --> 40:03.640
End the game.

40:03.720 --> 40:04.800
[To] Yeah, do it.

40:04.880 --> 40:09.480
[all] Dino! Dino! Dino!

40:09.560 --> 40:10.560
Wait.

40:11.920 --> 40:13.720
I think that's too easy.

40:13.800 --> 40:15.920
-That's right, put it in your mouth.
-[Whan] Hey! Hey! Hey!

40:16.000 --> 40:19.160
-What the fuck did you stop him?
-[shouting] Because I wanted to!

40:19.880 --> 40:21.800
I can't take your behavior anymore!

40:23.760 --> 40:25.440
What are you guys even doing?

40:26.120 --> 40:27.120
Huh?

40:27.680 --> 40:29.080
What are you doing?

40:31.080 --> 40:32.120
What the hell!

40:32.800 --> 40:35.440
Do you know how much money
your parents spend in order to raise you?

40:35.960 --> 40:37.520
Do you know how hard it was?

40:38.680 --> 40:40.560
Have you ever even thought about that?

40:41.120 --> 40:42.520
Have that even occurred to you?

40:44.280 --> 40:46.240
And what are you guys even gambling on?

40:46.840 --> 40:49.000
You're betting your lives for money?

40:50.000 --> 40:52.640
The fuck are you thinking, huh?

40:57.080 --> 40:59.800
To throw your life for money,
what a waste.

41:00.400 --> 41:01.880
I'm speaking to you as…

41:02.440 --> 41:03.760
a father,

41:04.240 --> 41:06.960
not because I'm older
or more mature than you.

41:08.080 --> 41:09.360
I'm the father of the person you--

41:09.440 --> 41:10.680
[metal clanging]

41:10.760 --> 41:11.720
[Whan screams]

41:11.800 --> 41:13.400
-[Pop grunts]
-Hey!

41:13.480 --> 41:16.400
That's enough! That's enough!

41:16.480 --> 41:17.640
Stop! Stop it!

41:17.720 --> 41:20.080
[Dino's mom screams]

41:20.160 --> 41:23.400
Why did you do this?

41:24.400 --> 41:26.120
How can you do this?

41:26.200 --> 41:28.240
-What are you doing?
-Don't shoot! Calm down!

41:28.320 --> 41:31.000
-It's the last bullet! Don't shoot!
-Whan, don't be scared now.

41:31.080 --> 41:33.280
She wouldn't dare to shoot
anyone of us here

41:33.360 --> 41:35.320
because she can't afford to pay
our hospital bills.

41:36.320 --> 41:40.040
[Dino's mom wailing]

41:40.120 --> 41:43.680
[Pop] Stupid woman.
Do you really think the gun is loaded?

41:44.360 --> 41:45.280
You fucking idiot!

41:45.360 --> 41:47.160
[screaming]

41:47.240 --> 41:48.960
[Dino screaming]
That's enough! Stop!

41:49.040 --> 41:50.400
That's enough!

41:50.480 --> 41:51.480
[Pop panting]

41:55.240 --> 41:56.480
[Tap] She's not moving.

41:58.760 --> 42:00.200
Is she dead?

42:01.720 --> 42:03.480
Pop, this is all your fault.

42:04.080 --> 42:06.520
Fuck. What should I do?

42:09.800 --> 42:11.240
[Nanno] It's not that hard.

42:13.800 --> 42:15.560
Just do what you've always done.

42:15.640 --> 42:19.240
[Nanno guffawing]

42:34.560 --> 42:39.160
"DO IT" CAMP

43:06.160 --> 43:07.240
Dad, Mom.

43:17.720 --> 43:19.240
How was Dhamma Camp, Dino?

43:38.320 --> 43:40.200
So, did you meditate a long time?

43:45.160 --> 43:46.280
No, Mom.

43:49.560 --> 43:52.040
[Dino's mom] I forgot
to pack your mosquito repellant.

43:52.120 --> 43:53.440
I'm sorry.

44:00.280 --> 44:01.480
[Dino's dad] Eat, son.

44:20.320 --> 44:22.640
Hey, Pop, you should give more
than everyone else.

44:23.960 --> 44:25.160
I'm totally broke, man.

44:26.560 --> 44:30.280
Dino, you don't have to. It wasn't you.

44:30.360 --> 44:33.160
You're the boss. You can clear things
up for us. Don't worry.

44:41.320 --> 44:42.560
350,000.

44:43.520 --> 44:45.160
This should be enough to keep shut.

44:48.360 --> 44:51.280
This includes compensation
to pay all of your hospital bills.

44:53.200 --> 44:55.240
[Dino] Don't… Don't tell anyone.

44:58.440 --> 44:59.520
[Whan] Take it.

45:12.960 --> 45:13.880
[Dino's dad] Dino.

45:14.600 --> 45:16.520
If you're going to another session
of Dhamma Camp,

45:17.160 --> 45:18.480
don't forget to tell us.

45:25.640 --> 45:26.920
What about you?

45:27.000 --> 45:28.680
What do you think money can buy?

45:30.440 --> 45:31.480
[giggles]

45:34.920 --> 45:37.560
[somber music playing]

45:42.320 --> 45:45.280
My opinion, money is the most
important thing in the whole world.

45:45.360 --> 45:47.680
If you don't have money,
you can't really do anything at all.

45:47.760 --> 45:51.920
I hope I have never have to live
without it. I mean… Fuck that.

45:52.000 --> 45:54.160
I don't know why I should live
without money. I deserve it.

45:54.240 --> 45:55.080
Who wants to do that?

45:55.640 --> 45:59.280
Oh… I think I'd be so unhappy.

45:59.360 --> 46:02.480
If I saw some new clothes that I like,
but I didn't have money to buy them,

46:02.560 --> 46:04.680
even just thinking about it
doesn't feel good.

46:04.760 --> 46:06.520
No, no, no. That's a no-no.

46:06.600 --> 46:08.240
If I were to imagine myself as poor,

46:08.320 --> 46:10.080
I can't think
of what that would be right now.

46:10.160 --> 46:11.280
Even now, I get stressed.

46:11.360 --> 46:14.160
When I only have 2,000 baht
in my wallet, I feel so poor.

46:14.240 --> 46:15.960
It can pretty much buy everything.

46:17.400 --> 46:19.880
We can even buy people with money.

46:19.960 --> 46:21.160
I came up with a project.

46:21.240 --> 46:23.640
When I grow up,
I want to contribute to society.

46:24.600 --> 46:28.600
I will buy all of this land.
I'll build a temple.

46:28.680 --> 46:33.880
I'm going to invite monks
and goddesses to pray all day.

46:33.960 --> 46:36.640
I'll invite poor people and then,

46:36.720 --> 46:39.440
I'll give the poor people
rice, rice, rice.

46:39.960 --> 46:42.000
so they will never go hungry again
in their lifetime.

46:47.520 --> 46:50.200
[somber music intensifies]

47:51.120 --> 47:53.120
Subtitle translation by Tanida Itthiwat
